         "人工智能正在迅速重塑全球劳动力市场，许多传统岗位面临自动化威胁。请分析AI取代人类工作的深远影响，并提出适应这一变革的对策。 || 开头：技术革命与就业结构性转型 || 原因与影响：机器学习与算法效率超越人工、部分岗位消失、技能鸿沟扩大；催生新兴科技岗位、提升生产力效率 || 对策：终身教育体系、政策保障与社会安全网建设 || 结尾：拥抱技术创新与劳动者转型的平衡之道 || （请写成4/5段：开头点题、2/3中间段、结尾总结。字数200-300）",
         "The rapid advancement of artificial intelligence is fundamentally reshaping the global labour market, rendering many traditional occupations vulnerable to automation. || On one hand, advanced algorithms and machine learning models can process complex tasks with unprecedented speed and accuracy, outperforming human workers in routine data processing, manufacturing, and even preliminary legal analysis. This shift inevitably leads to widespread job displacement and widens the skills gap, leaving non-specialised workers struggling to adapt. On the other hand, technological disruption simultaneously incubates entirely new industries, ranging from data engineering to AI ethics consulting, thereby boosting overall economic productivity. || To mitigate the adverse social consequences, governments and educational institutions must overhaul existing curricula to foster lifelong learning and continuous skill acquisition. Furthermore, establishing robust social safety nets and transitional training programs is imperative to support displaced workers during economic restructuring. || Ultimately, society must navigate this unprecedented technological transition by balancing relentless innovation with equitable human welfare guarantees.",
